stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received
    received --> identity_validated
    identity_validated --> policy_evaluated
    policy_evaluated --> awaiting_approval: approval required
    policy_evaluated --> capability_issued: allowed
    awaiting_approval --> capability_issued: approved
    capability_issued --> executing
    executing --> completed: success with finalized evidence
    executing --> contained: trust drift or incident
    state executing {
      [*] --> active
      active --> active: monitor and re-verify
    }
    received --> denied
    identity_validated --> denied
    policy_evaluated --> denied
    awaiting_approval --> denied: expired or denied
    contained --> denied
